                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "59e04915-eda1-38bf-8e72-4e393b235b03",
                        "entry_id": "2aceba84-5174-3431-8be7-99a083b9ca08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d02e547e-8b53-48d2-9ea5-ed238ce258e5",
                                "sense_id": "59e04915-eda1-38bf-8e72-4e393b235b03",
                                "text": "Claire would have wagered there was nothing in life that could make her like Nyssa.\nBut Claire had not counted on Nyssa herself. Nyssa's aim in life seemed to be to do whatever she wanted whenever she wanted to do it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0135139-9f78-4015-b17d-bf6a3db38084",
                                "sense_id": "59e04915-eda1-38bf-8e72-4e393b235b03",
                                "text": "“What?” Nyssa asks, in shock.\nBejine hurries from the area with his daughter in his arms. Barry, Nyssa and the rest quickly follow.\nBejine stops outside of the portal. He is about to enter it when Nyssa stops him.\n“You said 'only on this world'?\" Nyssa remarks. \"What did you mean by that?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06eab3cd-e8d6-411f-9b9c-09c631530a67",
                                "sense_id": "59e04915-eda1-38bf-8e72-4e393b235b03",
                                "text": "Bliss gasped, and Nyssa could not help the little giggle that escaped her. It was not often that someone could set her aunt back on her heels so firmly and neatly."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
